---
<BaseLayout title="Store | Lead Strategy" description="Digital products and packaged services from Lead Strategy.">
	<PageIntro kicker="Store" title="Practical products for small teams." lead="Templates, playbooks and packaged services will appear here after the files, licensing, tax treatment, refund terms and secure delivery flow are complete." />
	<section class="section shell"><div class="empty-state"><p class="kicker">Catalog preparation</p><h2>Nothing listed until it can be delivered properly.</h2><p>The MVP store will use secure hosted checkout and automatic digital delivery. Product pages will include clear outcomes, file formats, licence terms, support boundaries and prices in Canadian dollars.</p><a class="button button--outline" href="/contact/">Ask about a product</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
